1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,629
Welcome to Melody and
Barnaby's Music Nuggets!

2
00:00:05,629 --> 00:00:10,481
Today we are going to
learn about quavers.

3
00:00:12,481 --> 00:00:17,146
Remember the beat? We count
four beats in every bar.

4
00:00:17,346 --> 00:00:17,996
One.

5
00:00:18,046 --> 00:00:18,789
Two.

6
00:00:18,839 --> 00:00:19,629
Three.

7
00:00:19,679 --> 00:00:20,879
Four.

8
00:00:23,922 --> 00:00:27,240
Some notes last… one beat.

9
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:31,391
This note is called… a crotchet.

10
00:00:31,991 --> 00:00:36,424
In America… it is
called a quarter note.

11
00:00:39,224 --> 00:00:42,403
Four crotchets… fill the bar.

12
00:00:45,603 --> 00:00:49,758
Sometimes… we play two
sounds in one beat.

13
00:00:50,358 --> 00:00:52,887
Listen… ti-ti.

14
00:00:56,887 --> 00:01:00,438
These two notes… are quavers.

15
00:01:01,038 --> 00:01:04,589
Two quavers… fit in one beat.

16
00:01:11,789 --> 00:01:19,055
Quavers together are joined by a
beam. A quaver on its own has a flag.

17
00:01:25,255 --> 00:01:30,709
Eight quavers fill a bar, so
a quaver is an eighth note.

18
00:01:37,309 --> 00:01:39,235
Clap and count with me!

19
00:01:39,735 --> 00:01:40,385
One.

20
00:01:40,435 --> 00:01:41,178
Two.

21
00:01:41,228 --> 00:01:42,018
Three.

22
00:01:42,068 --> 00:01:43,268
Four.

23
00:01:44,411 --> 00:01:45,061
One.

24
00:01:45,111 --> 00:01:45,854
Two.

25
00:01:45,904 --> 00:01:46,693
Three.

26
00:01:46,743 --> 00:01:47,943
Four.

27
00:01:50,386 --> 00:01:53,194
Now… all ti-ti!

28
00:02:00,794 --> 00:02:03,834
Your turn! Look at the notes.

29
00:02:04,334 --> 00:02:08,489
How many beats… do
these two quavers last?

30
00:02:12,789 --> 00:02:13,989
One.

31
00:02:16,078 --> 00:02:18,236
What is this note called?

32
00:02:22,336 --> 00:02:25,561
A quaver… or an eighth note.

33
00:02:27,361 --> 00:02:29,147
Is this bar full?

34
00:02:33,247 --> 00:02:36,241
No! One beat is missing.

35
00:02:38,541 --> 00:02:39,863
You've got it!

36
00:02:41,563 --> 00:02:43,024
Now it's your turn!

37
00:02:43,224 --> 00:02:46,589
Play Ti-Ti Beats and clap along!

38
00:02:48,389 --> 00:02:53,059
Grown-ups, subscribe so
you never miss a Nugget.

39
00:02:53,109 --> 00:02:56,583
New ones every Wednesday and Saturday.

40
00:02:56,883 --> 00:02:59,273
See you for the next Nugget!

